# Workspace knowledge

IWE is this workspace's Markdown knowledge base. Its IWE root is `${IWE_ROOT}`.

IWE stores ${IWE_DOCUMENTS}. For those documentation kinds, use IWE first without asking. If IWE returns enough evidence, stop. If IWE has no relevant result, search the workspace narrowly.

For documentation kinds not listed above, use normal workspace search without asking.

Documents created in IWE must be written in ${IWE_LANGUAGE}, regardless of the user's language.
